0..78 Comment "// A shared view kept in a region: it lives as long as the capability scope or"
79..158 Comment "// the hold that opened the region rather than the access that lent it, and the"
159..261 Comment "// held value stays frozen until the region ends. A region is a static extent, ordered by outlives and"
262..339 Comment "// erased before anything runs: a value enters a region at any time and never"
340..413 Comment "// leaves it. Lifetimes stated by control rather than by a reference type"
414..465 Comment "// follow boats, \"References are like jumps\" (2024,"
466..543 Comment "// https://without.boats/blog/references-are-like-jumps/); regions as ordered"
544..619 Comment "// extents follow Koronkevich and Bowman, _Type Universes as Kripke Worlds_"
620..656 Comment "// (ICFP 2025, doi:10.1145/3747532)."
658..734 Comment "/// A thunk kept in the scope\'s region reads the held value through a shared"
735..790 Comment "/// view after the access that lent the view has ended."
